 Reason for change: In order to align all BS EMC specifications, this CR mirrors modifications from TS 37.113 and TS 37.114, introducing new section for the definition of EMC-specific manufacturer declarations to TS 38.113. Technical content was Endorsed in R4-2313995 during RAN4#108 meeting (Toulouse). Even though this is legacy issue, it is proposed to introduce it in Rel-18 version of specification (no specific need to introduce such modification to earlier releases). Summary of change: 4.5: adding explicit referneces to the decalrations in RF testing spec. 4.6: new section for EMC-specific manufacturer declarations, aligning. 6.2: adding more detailed cross-references to the declarations in RF test specs. 9.4, 9.5: new cross-references added for EMC-specific declarations. Consequences if not approved: Framework for introduction of EMC-specific declaration would be missing.
